 7–12 business days<\/li><li>Express Shipping: 5–7 business days<\/li><\/ul><h5><strong>Order Processing<\/strong><\/h5><ul><li>Orders are processed within 1–2 business days (Monday–Friday)<\/li><li>Orders placed after 12 PM PST, on weekends, or holidays will be processed the next business day<\/li><\/ul><h5><strong>Shipping Rates<\/strong><\/h5><ul><li>Shipping rates are calculated at checkout based on order size, weight, and shipping method<\/li><\/ul><h5><strong>International Shipping<\/strong><\/h5><ul><li>We ship worldwide<\/li><li>International delivery times and rates vary by destination<\/li><li>Customs fees, taxes, and import duties are the customer’s responsibility<\/li><\/ul><h5><strong>Order Tracking<\/strong><\/h5><ul><li>Tracking information will be emailed once your order ships<\/li><\/ul><h5><strong>Lost or Damaged Packages<\/strong><\/h5><ul><li>Contact support within 7 days of delivery for lost or damaged packages<\/li><\/ul><h5><strong>Shipping Address<\/strong><\/h5><ul><li>Please make sure your shipping address is correct before placing your order<\/li><\/ul>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_mYiBDp"]},"accordion_row_69qbbA":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Product Description","open_by_default":false,"icon":"paw_print","width":20},"blocks":{"text_hhKEky":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ closest.product.description }}","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_hhKEky"]},"accordion_row_JXaMJG":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Return & Refund","open_by_default":false,"icon":"return","width":20},"blocks":{"text_TMDz8J":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<h4><strong>Return & Refund Policy – Pet Advent Calendar<\/strong><\/h4><p>At PawUnder, every <strong>Pet Advent Calendar<\/strong> is crafted with care and attention to detail to bring joy, tradition, and festive excitement to your home. We stand behind the quality of our products — and if anything goes wrong, we’re here to make it right.<\/p><h4><strong>General Policy<\/strong><\/h4><p>Because the <strong>Pet Advent Calendar<\/strong> is a <strong>seasonal, limited-edition product<\/strong> containing multiple small acrylic pieces, we are <strong>unable to accept returns or refunds<\/strong> for personal preference or change of mind.<\/p><p>However, if your order arrives with an issue, you’re fully protected by our guarantee.<\/p><h4><strong>Eligibility for Refund or Replacement<\/strong><\/h4><p>We gladly offer <strong>refunds or replacements<\/strong> in the following situations:<\/p><h5><strong>1. Lost Package<\/strong><\/h5><p>If your order is lost during transit or not delivered within the expected timeframe.<\/p><h5><strong>2. Damaged or Defective Item<\/strong><\/h5><p>This includes:<\/p><ul><li>Broken, cracked, or bent acrylic ornaments<br\/><\/li><li>Scratched or damaged advent board<br\/><\/li><li>Major defects from shipping or production<br\/><\/li><\/ul><h5><strong>3. Incorrect Item Received<\/strong><\/h5><p>Such as:<\/p><ul><li>Wrong product<br\/><\/li><li>Missing ornaments<br\/><\/li><li>Wrong color or design variant<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>📌 <strong>Please contact us within 7 days of delivery<\/strong> to qualify for a replacement or refund.<\/p><h4>📧 <strong>How to Request a Refund or Replacement<\/strong><\/h4><p>Email us at <a><strong>cs@pawunder.com<\/strong><\/a> with:<\/p><ul><li>Your order number<br\/><\/li><li>Clear photos or videos of the issue<br\/><\/li><li>A brief description of the problem<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>Our support team will respond within 24–48 hours.<\/p><h4>🚫 <strong>Non-Returnable \/ Non-Refundable Cases<\/strong><\/h4><p>We cannot offer returns or refunds for:<\/p><ul><li>Change of mind after purchase<br\/><\/li><li>Damage caused by the customer<br\/><\/li><li>Minor imperfections that do not affect function<br\/><\/li><li>Color variations due to lighting or screen differences<br\/><\/li><li>Free gifts or Final Sale items<br\/><\/li><li>Small seasonal delays due to holidays<\/li><\/ul><h4>⏳ <strong>Refund Processing Time<\/strong><\/h4><p>If your refund is approved:<\/p><ul><li>Refunds will be processed back to your original payment method within <strong>5–10 business days<\/strong><br\/><br\/>(Processing time may vary depending on your bank or payment provider).<\/li><\/ul>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_TMDz8J"]}},"block_order":["accordion_row_wJKRGj","accordion_row_ncm8py","accordion_row_69qbbA","accordion_row_JXaMJG"]}},"block_order":["group_icgrde","divider_VJhene","text_XYmGp7","divider_JTaYcN","variant_picker_R3rGDr","custom_liquid_4cC3CC","custom_liquid_cW4dFN","custom_liquid_MwHUhf","buy_buttons_eYQEYi","vitals_ub_product_bundles_eAixDr","spacer_tYBrNQ","text_aEtTtq","image_kckM6y","accordion_tanykP"]}},"settings":{"content_width":"content-center-aligne